RTL FIXES REQUIRED BEFORE SYNTHESIS SUCCEEDED
----------------------------------------------
1. compute_core.sv: Replaced 'function automatic ... return acc' with
   direct $countones() assignment. Yosys does not support 'return'
   statements in synthesisable functions.
2. interface.sv: Changed non-blocking '<=' to blocking '=' on the
   reset-path array initialisation loop. Verilator rejects non-blocking
   assignments to unpacked arrays inside for-loops.
Both fixes are functionally equivalent; iverilog simulation still passes
4/4 tests after both changes.

